# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day26

I remember when I visited a restaurant that one of my friends recommended.

I expected it to be a small and quiet restaurant because of what my friend told me.

But when I arrived, it was much bigger and more crowded than I expected.

I didn't expect the restaurant to be so busy, especially on a weekday.

At first, I was a little surprised because we had to wait for about thirty minutes.

However, the food was really good, so I understood why the restaurant was popular.

In the end, I was glad that I went there, and I would definitely visit the restaurant again.
